/**
 * @component BpWeChatCustomTabBarStyle
 * @lang zh-CN 微信常驻 custom tabBar 的字面样式适配：视觉值与当前 HIA-uView `u-tabbar` 默认浅色契约一致，但不复制组件运行时或取得路由所有权。
 * @lang en Literal-style adapter for the persistent WeChat custom tab bar: visual values align with the current HIA-uView `u-tabbar` default-light contract, but it copies no component runtime and acquires no routing ownership.
 */

/* <lang><zh-CN>平台 custom-tab-bar 根始终固定在安全区上方并占满底边，同时显式采用与页面相同的思源黑体优先栈；它在 tab 页面切换时不随页面 slot 卸载。</zh-CN><en>The platform custom-tab-bar root remains fixed above the safe area, spans the bottom edge, and explicitly adopts the same Source Han Sans-first stack as pages; it does not unmount with page slots during tab switches.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 30;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: calc(62px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  padding: 6px 8px calc(6px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-top: 1px solid #e8edf3;
  background: #ffffff;
  font-family: "Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>每项均分宽度并以 24px 线性图标、12px 文字和 50px 触控高度构成稳定纵向导航，不依赖固定字符宽度。</zh-CN><en>Each item receives equal width and forms stable vertical navigation from a 24px line icon, 12px text, and a 50px touch height without relying on fixed character widths.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 3px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 50px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 3px 2px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: #27364a;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>移除微信 button 的默认伪元素边框，避免与 HIA-uView 风格产生双边框。</zh-CN><en>Remove WeChat button's default pseudo-element border, avoiding a double border against the HIA-uView visual contract.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item::after { border: 0; }

/* <lang><zh-CN>按压态只降低透明度作为短暂反馈，不生成与设计板不符的持续 pill 或色块。</zh-CN><en>The pressed state only lowers opacity for transient feedback and creates no persistent pill or surface block that conflicts with the design board.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item--pressed { opacity: 0.68; }

/* <lang><zh-CN>选中态由钴蓝图标、文字与字重共同表达；背景保持白色，不使用 pill。</zh-CN><en>The selected state is expressed by the cobalt icon, label, and weight together; the background remains white and uses no pill.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item--active {
  background: transparent;
  color: #0047ab;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>图标的 24px 几何框在四项之间保持一致；颜色由原创 SVG 源稿派生的本地透明 PNG 运行时资产确定。</zh-CN><en>The icon's 24px geometry remains consistent across all four items; the local transparent PNG runtime asset derived from the original SVG source determines its color.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__icon {
  display: block;
  flex: none;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>单行标签在小屏空间不足时截断，不改变实际 locale 文案。</zh-CN><en>The single-line label truncates when small-screen space is insufficient without changing actual locale copy.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__label {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 16px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
